    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fire "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "heats",
            "ref": "v-heat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your soup. Fire warms your rooms. Fire "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lights up",
            "ref": "v-light-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the night. But "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "watch out",
            "ref": "v-watch-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! Fire can be dangerous."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Children can help to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "prevent",
            "zh": "阻止"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " fires. If you find "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "matches",
            "zh": "火柴"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", give them to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "grown-up",
            "zh": "成年人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Do not try to light them. Fire is hot. Don’t touch fire. Don’t touch hot things. Just look."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If you see a fire, quickly tell a grown-up. If you are inside a building that’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "on fire",
            "ref": "v-on-fire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", go outside. If there is smoke, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "crawl",
            "zh": "匍匐行进"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " under it. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Stay low and go",
            "ref": "v-stay-low"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Don’t go back inside."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If your clothes are on fire, stop where you are. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Drop",
            "zh": "倒下"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the ground. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Roll",
            "ref": "v-roll"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " around to stop the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flames",
            "zh": "火焰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Remember",
            "ref": "v-remember"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these three words: STOP. DROP. ROLL."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Finally, learn how to call the fire "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "department",
            "ref": "v-department"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " where you live."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
